From: PlezyNG <dev@plezyng.app>
Subject: [PATCH] desktop: run reduced PME models at model resolution

Scale each decoded pair to the fixed model shape before flow, Vulkan warp,
inference, and reconstruction, then upscale the synthesized midpoint to the
source dimensions. Keep submitted-pair deadline accounting and timing telemetry.

diff --git a/video/filter/vf_plezy_pme.c b/video/filter/vf_plezy_pme.c
index bbdf2fa..1d67a9c 100644
--- a/video/filter/vf_plezy_pme.c
+++ b/video/filter/vf_plezy_pme.c
